@template dry
== career.worried
? tier>=colleague flag:career.missed
- The board noticed you weren't there. So did I. I'm quieter about it.
? tier>=friend flag:career.low
- An appointment with the Chief. Wear something sensible. Mostly, listen.
? tier>=friend flag:career.verylow
- The ready room. Mind the step. And then mind your shifts. I'm serious.   #serious
? tier>=friend flag:career.bottom
- I'd rather not lose you to paperwork. Go to work tomorrow. Humour me.   #serious
? tier>=friend flag:career.up
- On shift again. Look at you. Practically furniture.   #funny
== career.eve
? tier>=friend flag:career.eve
- Tomorrow, then. I had a joke ready. It's not funny. I'm sorry, {nick}.   #serious
== career.bye
? tier>=friend flag:career.lastday
- Go on. I'll pretend I'm fine. I'm very good at it.   #warm
